Build a production-quality "MotionCards" animation library containing 30 DISTINCT card animation systems.

PRIMARY GOAL

I want a visual reference website where I can:

Browse 30 card animations
→ See each animation working live
→ Open a larger demo
→ Understand how the animation behaves
→ Copy a reusable implementation prompt
→ Paste that prompt into another project
→ Apply the same motion to ANY existing UI element

The animations must NOT be coupled to the example card design.

They must be reusable for:

- Cards
- Images
- Portfolio projects
- Product cards
- Testimonials
- Services
- Team members
- Pricing cards
- Blog cards
- Website screenshots
- App screenshots
- Gallery items
- Videos
- Custom React components

==================================================
TECHNOLOGY
==================================================

SHOWCASE WEBSITE:

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Vanilla JavaScript

No backend or database is required.

However, every generated "Copy Prompt" must describe how to recreate that animation using:

- React / Next.js
- TypeScript
- Framer Motion / Motion for React
- CSS 3D transforms where appropriate

