FRAMER MOTION REQUIREMENTS FOR COPIED PROMPTS
==================================================

Every animation's reusable prompt should tell the implementation agent to choose the appropriate Framer Motion APIs.

Potential APIs include:

motion.div
variants
animate
initial
whileHover
whileTap
whileInView
useMotionValue
useSpring
useTransform
useScroll
useMotionValueEvent
layout
layoutId
AnimatePresence

Do NOT blindly use all APIs for every animation.

Choose only what makes sense for that motion system.

==================================================
SPRING PHYSICS
==================================================

Prefer physically coherent spring motion for interactive animations.

General starting point:

transition={{
  type: "spring",
  stiffness: 180,
  damping: 24,
  mass: 0.8
}}

Do NOT apply this exact configuration everywhere.

For:

Elastic Bounce:
use lower damping.

For:

Minimal Fade & Slide:
prefer tween/easing.

For:

Pointer tracking:
use motion values + springs.

For:

Continuous loops:
use linear timing.

Motion character must match the animation.

