==================================================
PERFORMANCE
==================================================

Do not run 30 complex animations continuously.

Animations should have three behaviors:

AUTOPLAY:
Only where necessary.

Examples:
Infinite Loop
Wave

DEMO CYCLE:
Run animation
→ pause
→ repeat

INTERACTIVE:
Only animate when user interacts.

Examples:
Tilt
Magnetic
Flip Reveal

Use IntersectionObserver:

if preview leaves viewport:
pause unnecessary animation.

Prefer GPU-friendly transforms.

==================================================
RESPONSIVE MOTION
==================================================

Animations must adapt—not simply shrink.

Desktop:
full animation geometry.

Tablet:
slightly reduce distances, depth and perspective.

Mobile:
reduce large rotations and translation distances while preserving the recognizable animation.

Touch interactions must replace hover-only dependencies.

Never create horizontal document overflow.

==================================================
ACCESSIBILITY
==================================================

Respect:

prefers-reduced-motion

Provide reduced-motion alternatives.

Support keyboard controls where applicable.

Ensure focus states remain visible.

Interactive cards cannot rely exclusively on hover.

